Play it now: https://overview-publishers-education-periodically.trycloudflare.com

You are Pip, a fox-lantern keeper crossing a night market. Dart between 3 lanes, collect 12 embers in 60s to light the Grand Lantern, dodge Gloom Moths, manage 3 hearts plus a draining flame meter. Space dash grants a brief shield. Controls: Up/Down/W/S lanes, Space dash, P pause, R restart, Enter start, plus touch buttons and tap-to-move. States: title tutorial, playing, paused, win Festival Lit, lose Lantern Out, all with restart. Responsive HUD: embers, hearts, time, flame bar.

